# Trivy ignore list for the agentweaver-agent-host image.
#
# ⚠️ This file does NOT weaken the Trivy gate: severity (HIGH,CRITICAL),
# exit-code (1), and ignore-unfixed (true) in
# .github/workflows/agent-host-maintenance.yml are unchanged. Every entry
# below is a specific CVE ID verified, at the time it was added, to have NO
# available fix in the newest upstream release of the binary that carries
# it — these are third-party, statically-compiled Go binaries (yq, gh CLI)
# whose embedded stdlib/grpc-go/x-net/x-text versions we cannot patch
# ourselves. Any CVE not listed here still fails the build.
#
# Re-evaluate this list on every maintenance rebuild (weekly, or whenever
# this file is touched): if a newer upstream release closes an entry, remove
# it so Trivy resumes enforcing it.
#
# No active suppressions remain. Keep the file so the workflow path stays
# stable and future, explicitly-reviewed suppressions have a canonical home.
